{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a Corpo-run Megacity locked in tense conflict with a slum-based Resistance, two strangers are forced into a deadly alliance. Their quest will pit them against all the terrors their dystopic home can muster. But in their world, the truth is the most dangerous weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our story follows two protagonists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amir</strong>: A grim corporate enforcer suffering from total amnesia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aurora</strong>: A selfless and determined Resistance hacker motivated by love.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Echo of Souls</i> features a  <strong>character-swapping mechanic</strong> that lets players switch between two distinct play styles seamlessly. The first character excels in physical combat and brute strength, perfect for taking down enemies head-on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/d6fd37f046cdd7e873528d1f8e8cec2e.poster.avif?t=1772375250\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/d6fd37f046cdd7e873528d1f8e8cec2e.webm?t=1772375250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/d6fd37f046cdd7e873528d1f8e8cec2e.mp4?t=1772375250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second character introduces new elements to the game, range attacks and environmental manipulation to overcome obstacles and outsmart opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/5ff71b7812986671270d9454b6d39586.poster.avif?t=1772375250\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/5ff71b7812986671270d9454b6d39586.webm?t=1772375250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/5ff71b7812986671270d9454b6d39586.mp4?t=1772375250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This dynamic system adds depth to gameplay, encouraging players to adapt their strategies to different challenges, whether in combat, exploration, or puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/9d5c8cf9804e4dec62df32457e69e9fd.poster.avif?t=1772375250\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/9d5c8cf9804e4dec62df32457e69e9fd.webm?t=1772375250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/extras/9d5c8cf9804e4dec62df32457e69e9fd.mp4?t=1772375250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3363800?t=1772375250","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3363800?t=1772375250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/160f8b547c103159fd84ad3157f55a653811f276/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772375250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363800/160f8b547c103159fd84ad3157f55a653811f276/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=177